@startuml
title System context — draft
left to right direction

actor "Person using the mobile app" as User
rectangle "Mobile decision-support application" as App
actor "Healthcare specialist" as Specialist

User --> App : photographs or uploads skin image
App --> User : preliminary classification
class probabilities
specialist recommendation
medical disclaimer
User ..> Specialist : consults when recommended

note bottom of App
  Decision support only.
  Not a medical diagnosis.
end note

note right of Specialist
  Outside the application.
  No system integration or data sharing is specified.
end note
@enduml
